# UBSan ignorelist for the "clang asan+ubsan strict" tests_cpp CI lane.
# The strict checks (unsigned wraparound, implicit conversions) flag behaviour
# that is well defined and intended in the standard library, e.g. the
# multiply-with-wrap in std::mt19937_64 seeding. Our headers and the vendored
# LEMON live under the checkout, not /usr, and stay checked.
src:/usr/*
